description             Easy to integrate Vulkan memory allocation library
long_description        A single header C/C++ library that helps with memory \
                        allocation for the Vulkan API.  The interface mirrors \
                        Vulkan and is designed to be cross-platform while \
                        still making use of extensions when supported.

